for retail investors on Wednesday, clearing funds from Kasikorn Asset Management and SCB Asset Management to list on the Stock Exchange of Thailand (SET), according to a notice published by the regulator. Until now, spot bitcoin funds in Thailand were limited to institutional and ultra-high-net-worth investors. The new ETFs will hold bitcoin directly with local custodians and are expected to begin trading on November 6. Retail investors will be able to buy them through ordinary brokerage accounts. An SEC official confirmed the approval to The Block.\",\"title\":\"Thailand's SEC opens spot bitcoin ETFs to retail investors, approving two funds to list on SET\",\"url\":\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-10-21-thailand-sec-opens-spot-bitcoin-etfs-to-retail-investors-two-funds-to-list-on-set-421179\"},\"message\":{\"item_id\":\"ITM-01M5DTYHP4C1VW6WAK9C07XKG0\",\"kind\":\"NEW_ITEM\"}}", "type": "text"}], "type": "user.message"}, "last_payload": {"item_id": "ITM-01M5DTYHP4C1VW6WAK9C07XKG0", "kind": "NEW_ITEM"}, "messages": ["22cb6538a69465e98bdf471da22bcd799d6c057aaf0c101aa3abde8eda6947e9"], "missing_fields": {}, "model_id": "gpt-6.1-sol", "model_id_basis": "RESOLVED_SESSION_AGENT", "native_execution_receipts": {"sevt_-6sHkixHvX_kdGhfjQxzk": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_6f331a16cb18efc939799736b2951d6649d880946fdef7c2c7f51156c7821a8a_0", "id": "sevt_-6sHkixHvX_kdGhfjQxzk", "processed_at": "2026-10-20T23:56:09.384Z", "stop_reason": {"event_ids": ["call_9a46966785094aa6ab25bd5683db9d77|fc_0b411e810015987f016ad7ff976c548191b3f4c0692e2738e9"], "type": "requires_action"}, "type": "session.status_idle"}, "sevt_3TbqR5LBeGcfgtEYEm2mP": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_63ce5c7971d440dce05a047bc941aa20e4795c4b79cc0efa188072363b4f7387_0", "id": "sevt_3TbqR5LBeGcfgtEYEm2mP", "processed_at": "2026-10-20T23:45:39.024Z", "type": "session.status_running"}, "sevt_6x8nhyWUYsvXtpC2SiRAX": {"execution_id": "sevt_req_349f68e65b81b2d166f35c9c1094bea761fd5ec2d9aba7ab01aacb9d45e844c1_0", "id"